    <briefdescription>
<para>Real cloud SDK implementations for S3, Azure Storage, and Google Cloud Storage. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.0.15 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY</para>
</simplesect>
This header provides helper functions to integrate real cloud SDKs with ThemisDB&apos;s callback-based cloud backup system. Applications can use these functions to initialize cloud provider callbacks with real SDK implementations.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>AWS<sp/>S3</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;<ref refid="cloud__sdk__integration_8h" kindref="compound">sharding/cloud_sdk_integration.h</ref>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1sharding_1aea13c4ca467bed2a45aac1f7cf102bce" kindref="member">themis::sharding::initializeS3Provider</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;us-east-1&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-bucket&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>Azure<sp/>Blob<sp/>Storage</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1sharding_1a1ac474cfba94d584b5d4feadd890f65c" kindref="member">themis::sharding::initializeAzureProvider</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-account&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-container&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;connection-string&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>Google<sp/>Cloud<sp/>Storage</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1sharding_1a503854558a6fef650ba2bf3053edff5b" kindref="member">themis::sharding::initializeGCSProvider</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-project&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-bucket&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;/path/to/credentials.json&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Now<sp/>create<sp/>coordinator<sp/>-<sp/>callbacks<sp/>are<sp/>set<sp/>and<sp/>ready</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>coordinator<sp/>=<sp/>std::make_unique&lt;CloudBackupCoordinator&gt;(agent,<sp/>manager,<sp/>config);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="cloud__backup_8h" kindref="compound">cloud_backup.h</ref> for callback setter functions </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
